OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new week will start dry
OL,6,Fwith hot spells of sunshine developing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning and early
OL,8,Fafternoon. Cooler near the east coast
OL,9,Fthough with an onshore breeze. Later
OL,10,Fcloud will increase, with the chance
OL,11,Fof an early evening shower.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a rather cloudy
OL,14,Fevening with the chance of a few more
OL,15,Fshowers, especially in the north and
OL,16,Fwest. Overnight though it will become
OL,17,Fdry with clearer spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
